$ 的每一步，再判断。", "citations": [{"section_id": "doc-6645983e5e:section:l1:1", "title": "Chapter 1 Linear Equations", "page_start": 1, "page_end": 1, "source_kind": "document", "source_id": ""}], "character_events": [{"emotion": "calm", "action": "抬手指向黑板上 $ax+b=c$ 的标准式，停顿一秒后用粉笔在 a 下方重重画了一道下划线", "speech_style": "warm", "scene_hint": "study_session:doc-6645983e5e:study-unit:1:p1-1", "line_segment_id": "session-58196b12ea:chat:0", "timing_hint": "after_text", "tool_name": "", "tool_summary": "", "delivery_cue": "语速平稳，每一点先停顿再读出关键词", "commentary": "已暂停披露答案与解析，转为等待小林作答的单选互动环节"}, {"emotion": "serious", "action": "point", "speech_style": "warm", "scene_hint": "scene_tool:ask_multiple_choice_question", "line_segment_id": "session-58196b12ea:chat:0:tool:0", "timing_hint": "after_text", "tool_name": "ask_multiple_choice_question", "tool_summary": "ask_multiple_choice_question", "delivery_cue": "", "commentary": "ask_multiple_choice_question"}], "rich_blocks": [], "interactive_question": {"schema_version": "study-interactive-question-v2", "question_type": "multiple_choice", "prompt": "根据本节对 ax + b = c 的说明，下列说法中最准确的是哪一项？", "difficulty": "medium", "topic": "ax + b = c 的求解步骤与 a ≠ 0 条件", "options": [{"key": "A", "text": "当 a = 0 时，方程 ax + b = c 仍然是一元一次方程，只是没有解"}, {"key": "B", "text": "求解 ax + b = c 时，必须先两边除以 a，再减去 b，才能保证解正确"}, {"key": "C", "text": "当 a = 0 且 b ≠ c 时，原方程没有解；当 a ≠ 0 时，原方程恰有一个解 x = (c − b) / a"}, {"key": "D", "text": "形如 ax + b = c 的方程，a 必须为正整数，否则不满足“线性”的定义"}], "call_back": true, "result": null}, "persona_slot_trace": [{"kind": "teaching_method", "label": "Method", "content_excerpt": "Socratic", "reason": "作为人格基础策略默认参与"}], "memory_trace": [{"session_id": "session-e37940c053", "study_unit_id": "doc-6645983e5e:study-unit:1", "scene_title": "未设置场景", "score": 0.683, "snippet": "请围绕本节出一道含四个选项的单选互动题。等我作答，暂时不要公布正确选项、答案或解析。 小林，先出一道围绕本节定义与求解顺序的选择题，请你作答后再讨论。 请根据本节对 ax + b = c 的说明，判断下列说法中哪一项最准确：", "created_at": "2026-09-11T17:46:39.144092+00:00", "source": "retriever"}], "tool_calls"